  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fmanage%252faff.php%253faff%253d372\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jOQL2ro.png\" alt=\"雪之精灵模组\" width=\"1372\" height=\"1001\"></a></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;message=Twitter&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries 推特\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Youtube&amp;message=Twitter&amp;logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries YouTube\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 关于模组 📖</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">雪之精灵是一款以冬季为主题的模组，添加了大量装饰性方块与特色功能！本模组高度可配置，所有方块和物品均可调整或禁用。主要特色包括：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6lPE3bSGgok?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br>本项目开发于2021冬季创作节</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🛷 雪橇系统 🛷<br></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 雪橇是在雪地移动的新方式。与船只不同，雪橇会沿地形曲线滑行，能流畅上下坡</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 下坡时会持续加速，可用来设计滑雪赛道</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 雪橇在冰面机动性更强，在雪地滑行时仍可转向，甚至能通过90度旋转实现急停（就像现实中那样！）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 可放置箱子提供储物空间，也支持潜影盒和Supplementaries模组的收纳袋</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 可用拴绳连接驯服的狼。狼拉雪橇时机动性、速度提升，上坡几乎不会减速</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 冰屋现在会生成带储物箱的雪橇，内含冬季主题战利品</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 在雪橇上放置地毯可自定义外观，还能防止在粉末雪上滑行时冻伤</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☃️ 村民冬季AI ☃️</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 冬季期间村民会在自家门口挂花环（每户仅限一个），春季来临时会自动收回。挂花环行为发生在空闲时段（如0刻左右）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 安装Supplementaries模组后，村民还会在集会时间（9000刻后）于集会点放置内含礼物的礼物盒（每户限一个）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 针叶林/冻原生物群的幼年村民会在玩耍时间向所见实体投掷雪球</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • \"冬季时段\"可通过配置文件调整，默认从12月20日持续至1月30日</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 安装Serene Seasons模组后，可设置为跟随季节更替</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🎁 新增方块 🎁<br></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 生姜：新作物，可合成姜饼方块（装饰用）。野生生姜生成于稀疏丛林生物群系</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 软糖：全色系可产，能被实体推动，兼具按钮与压力板功能（全方向触发）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 拐杖糖：字面意义的甜蜜物品，可合成装饰性拐杖糖方块</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 花环：可挂在门上增添圣诞氛围，兼容所有模组门</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 荧光灯饰：可附着于树叶使其发光，用剪刀拆除或直接破坏</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 雪景球：放置在下雪区域时会切换为飘雪状态</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 新唱片：冬季主题音乐唱片，稀有存在于礼物盒和冰屋雪橇箱中</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🍪 姜饼傀儡 🍪</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 在姜饼块上放置南瓜，再以软糖按钮为躯干即可创造姜饼傀儡</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 这些可爱生物会像宠物般跟随主人（不会传送），潜行点击可令其坐下</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 空腹时右键点击可咬食它们——毕竟是行走的饼干嘛！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 喂食其他姜饼可修复肢体损伤</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 注意！牛奶会伤害它们，水也是</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 拥有16种颜色对应的不同性格</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 姜饼屋是雪地生物群系的新结构，功能类似雪地女巫小屋，内有女巫和自然生成的姜饼傀儡</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持开发者❤️</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模组开发耗费大量时间，如果您喜欢我的作品，可通过以下方式支持。支持者将获赠定制<strong>地球仪</strong>或<strong>雕像</strong>！使用优惠码\"supplementaries\"在Akliz购买服务器同样适用。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要服务器？Akliz提供专业模组服务器托管服务。</span></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他们拥有温馨的社区、优质的支持服务和卓越的服务器性能<br>使用优惠码\"supplementaries\"可享<strong>8折优惠</strong>，同时支持我的开发工作！</span><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🏆 特别鸣谢 🏆</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">DemiMark - 雪橇音效</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">SophieTheTrophy - 姜块音效</span></li>\n</ul>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的模组 🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"惊魂丰收\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"雪之精灵\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"储物标签\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"山羊之力\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"神秘橡树\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"地毯楼梯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"嗯嗯嗯嗯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"摩艾石像\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"JEED效果描述\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"更好的睡莲\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"进度相框\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"随机矿\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/788/418/638141921847312709.png\" alt=\"安眠之夜\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heartstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/555/637793261935851502.gif\" alt=\"心灵宝石\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a></span></span></p>",
